<title>JAPAN: Tokio Marine says wary on foreign bond investment.</title>
<headline>Tokio Marine says wary on foreign bond investment.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokio Marine and Fire Insurance Co Ltd will be cautious in its plans to invest in foreign bonds in the current business year, ending next March 31, a senior executive of the company told a news conference on Thursday.</p>
<p>The executive gave no other details about the firm's foreign investment plan. The company earlier on Thursday announced earnings results for the year ended March 31, 1997.</p>
